        {
            "source_entity_instance": "Pacific Decadal Oscillation",
            "source_entity_type": "Teleconnection",
            "relation": "INFLUENCES_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "North Pacific",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Discrepancies between the observed and simulated estimates, particularly in the North Pacific, may be in part associated with the unresolved long-term mode of natural variability in observations (e.g. Pacific Decadal Oscillation; Mantua et al 1997) as agreement exists in the observations however is absent in the MMM.",
