            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "To evaluate the long-term halosteric and thermosteric SL changes from CMIP5 Historical simulations (Taylor et al 2012), we consider data from two independent observational analyses (Ishii and Kimoto 2009, Durack and Wijffels 2010\u2014hereafter Ish09 and DW10 respectively).",
